72. When salaries are paid to employees, which of the following accounts is credited?
(A) Salaries A/C. (B) Emplryees ryC. (C) Cash I/C. (D) None of the above.
73. A chque of Rs. 5,000/- was not crcdiEd by bank. Cash at bank as per Cash Bookshowed Rs. 1,17,000/- afur the deposit. What will be the bank balance as per bankpass book?
(A) Rs. L,L2,0001- (B) Rs. L,t7,0O0l- (C) Rs. L,22,0001- (D) None of the above.
74. Upon receipt of notification by bank that a cheque issued by Karim & Co. amountingto Rs. 3,000/- has been dishonoured, which of the fullowing acounts is to bedebiEd?
(A) Cash A/C. (B) Bank n/C. (C) Karim & Co. I/C. (D) Cheque sDishonourcd A/C.
75. Payment rmeived from Mr. X of Rs. 650 has been wrongly entered in the cash bookas Rs. 560. Choose the mrrect adjustment in the cash book.
(A) Rs. 560 will be debited.(B) Rs. 650 will be credited.(C) Rs. 90 will be debited.(D) Rs. 90 wi!! be credited.
76. Rs. 5,000/- received from Mr. X has been wrongly posted in the cash book as Rs.5,000/- paid b him. Choose the con€ct adjustment in the cash book.
(A) Rs. 5,000/ will be debited.(B) Rs. 5,000/- wil! be credited.(C) Rs. 10,000/ will be debited.(D) Rs. 10,000/- will be credited.
77. Rs. 5,000/- received fiom Mr. X has been entercd twice in the cash book. Choose theconect adjustment in the cash book.
(A) Rs. 5,000/ will be debited.(B) Rs. 5,000/- will be crediH.(C) Rs. 10,000/ will be debiEd.(D) Rs. 10,000/- will be crcdited.
78. What is the full turm of FRSR?
(A) Fundamental Rules and Subsidiary Rules.(B) Financial Rule and Supplementary Regulations.(C) Fiscal Rules and Subsidiary Regulations.(D) Finance RegulaUons and Sentice Rules.
